# impeccable-ignore-start
# Ephemeral output, runtime state, and per-dev overrides.
# Unanchored so the active project may live at the repository root or below a
# nested workspace. Shared artifacts remain tracked: config.json,
# live/config.json, design.json, surfaces/*.md, and critique/*.md.
